#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-A expect=violation domain=ADAE
#note "Isolates the BASECAyN arm. AVALCA2N is NOT declared; BASECA2N matches the second varname() regex (D-15 rewrite, 2026-09-12) and the per-variable evaluation emits exactly ONE finding for that one column, pinned by variable_name. No expansion and no wildcards block remain - the y range 1-99 lives in the regex ([1-9]|[1-9][0-9])."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt variable_name=BASECA2N
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AEDECOD  type=Char
col BASECA2N type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | 1
